{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Marisa  $Eirin  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Marisa Kirisame",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the unchanging goddess."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eientei."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >..."
            ]
        },
        "56_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A house in the Bamboo Forest of the Lost, where Lunarians live in hiding."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Oi, you made this Incident Stone didn't you."
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >How did you come to that conclusion?"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >I ran into a Lunarian when I was solving the incident."
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Not only that, this stone is practically oozing with aura from the Eternal Night incident."
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >You just dragged me into some fracas between Lunarians again didn't you."
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Like the time with the Ultramarine Orb Elixir."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >Why yes, by your definition I did drag you into it."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >Though, I wasn't the one who prepared the stone."
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was a god who specializes in making orbs."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >A god who specializes in making orb...Who was that again?"
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >I merely came up with the plan to save Gensokyo and handled matters between the Lunar Capital and Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Well, can't say I care too much about who made it."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "More importantly, you knew right from the start about this incident didn't you?"
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >Yes, the cause of the incident this time was an attack from the outside world."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Gensokyo aside, at the rate it was happening, Lunar Capital would not have lasted."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It demanded something drastic."
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Wait, an attack from the outside?"
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >Not on purpose most likely."
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However, the impurity coming from outside had reached a level not even Gensokyo could hold."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Lunar Capital would have been destroyed."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Couldn't you just let them be? It's not like Gensokyo was in any danger."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >I can’t really say about that."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even though Gensokyo is filled with impurity, who knows what might happen if it were to cross the threshold."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In any case, the Lunar Capital decided to borrow the stone princess' powers. The one you defeated, Ariya Iwanaga."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Her immense power stopped not only the impurity from outside but also Gensokyo along with it."
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >But that plan ended up also involving Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >I had to leave Gensokyo in capable hands."
            ]
        },
        "41_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A human who had experienced the incidents all over over Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That human would be able to escape the effects of unchanging, then reach Ariya and keep her in check."
            ]
        },
        "43_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >And that human...was that me?"
            ]
        },
        "44_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >Yes, you."
            ]
        },
        "45_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I hoped that you would accomplish that."
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Thank you Marisa Kirisame, the great magician."
            ]
        },
        "47_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Heh… well, you really didn't have to put it like that. It was no big deal."
            ]
        },
        "48_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You can count on me if you ever need help."
            ]
        }
    }
}